    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22269" root="شرى" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرًى</span></b> , (S, TA,) an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَى</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَشْرِى</span>,
(TA,) [when used as a simple subst., signifying
<i>A sale</i> and also <i>a purchase,</i>] has <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْرِيَةٌ</span> for its pl.,
which, as pl. of a sing. of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعَلٌ</span>, is
anomalous. (S, TA.)

